)?</h3>
<div itemprop=3D"acceptedAnswer" itemscope=3D"" itemtype=3D"http://schema.o=
rg/Answer"><div itemprop=3D"text"><p>The Euler phi(n) calculation can be co=
ded with an algorithm like:<code><br>function phi(n) {<br> r =3D n;<br> for=
 (i =3D 2; i*i &lt;=3D n; i++) {<br>  if (n % i =3D=3D 0) {<br>   r -=3D r =
/ i;<br>   while (n % i =3D=3D 0) {<br>    n /=3D i;<br>   }<br>  }<br> }<b=
r> r -=3D r / n;<br> return r;<br>}</code></p></div></div></div>
